{"product":{"id":8476539257171,"title":"SYSTEM 4 BIO BOTANICAL SERUM","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"short_description_block\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"rte align_justify\" id=\"short_description_content\" itemprop=\"description\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBIO BOTANICAL SERUM BY SYSTEM 4\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eScalp circulatory stimulating serum\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSerum that stimulates the superficial circulation of the scalp for all hair types. Antiseptic natural extracts, salicylic acid and menthol disinfect and soothe the scalp, while refreshing and limiting sebum secretion. Regular use creates conditions for healthy hair growth. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCreates suitable conditions for the growth of healthy hair on the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eStimulates the microcirculation of the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSuitable for all hair types\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eParfume free and dermatologically tested\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply serum directly to scalp and rub into scalp with light rotating motions. Do not rinse. Can be used daily or between washes. Used to support the effects of Bio Botanical Shampoo and Vital Cure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003epH 4.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/di